# Fence boundaries isolate ALU publication to the two ADD instructions.
# The older ADD needs the outstanding DIV; the younger ADD is independent.
@name whole-core-ooo-issue-overlap
@maxcycles 2000
@verifies funcSelectOldestReady propRsIssueOnlyReady funcCommitHead propCommitInOrder
li x5 0x7fffffff
li x6 3
li x10 11
li x11 31
fence
div x7, x5, x6
add x8, x7, x10
add x9, x10, x11
fence
check x7 == 0x2aaaaaaa
check x8 == 0x2aaaaab5
check x9 == 42
expect done
